      "text": "Jerusalem to be carried captive into Babylon, 1 Ne. 1:13 (10:3; 2 Ne. 25:10; Omni 1:15). the Lord will do his pleasure on Babylon, 1 Ne. 20:14 (Isa. 48:14). go ye forth of Babylon, 1 Ne. 20:20 (Isa. 48:20). burden of Babylon, which Isaiah1 saw, 2 Ne. 23:1 (Isa. 13:1). Babylon shall be as when God overthrew Sodom and Gomorrah, 2 Ne. 23:19 (Isa. 13:19). take up proverb against king of Babylon, 2 Ne. 24:4 (Isa. 14:4). the Lord will cut off from Babylon the name, 2 Ne. 24:22 (Isa. 14:22). Babylon shall be destroyed, 2 Ne. 25:15.",
